{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\"issues\":[{\"sec\":\"S05\",\"screen\":\"可连开心的旧事都不敢想又太为难自己\",\"source\":\"可连过去开心的事都不敢多想，也太为难自己了。\",\"type\":\"8\",\"severity\":\"轻微\",\"why\":\"原文是不敢多想，屏幕稿变成不敢想，程度加重，仿佛连一点都不敢想。\"},{\"sec\":\"S07\",\"screen\":\"刚才的思绪一下被打断，换了副热闹步子心里却安定不下来\",\"source\":\"新出现的舞步可以很鲜明，内心却未必因此安定下来。\",\"type\":\"2\",\"severity\":\"轻微\",\"why\":\"原文只是说内心未必安定，屏幕稿变成了确定无法安定。\"},{\"sec\":\"S09\",\"screen\":\"像又遇见当初不知所措的自己，走过这一路问题还是没答案\",\"source\":\"最初的问题又浮上来，却没有因此得到一个简单的答案。\",\"type\":\"8\",\"severity\":\"轻微\",\"why\":\"原文说没有得到简单的答案，并未排除存在复杂答案，屏幕稿却断言问题没有答案。\"},{\"sec\":\"S10\",\"screen\":\"先前的摇篮曲在F小调上破碎重现，听来凄厉哀婉\",\"source\":\"另一种更凄厉哀婉的听法，是听见先前那段摇篮曲破碎地重现，只是这次变成了F小调。\",\"type\":\"2\",\"severity\":\"轻微\",\"why\":\"原文明确标明这只是另一种听法，屏幕稿省去这一限定，将主观听法写成了确定的音乐描述。\"},{\"sec\":\"S11\",\"screen\":\"再心动，他也【不愿】只凭一点指望就回去忍让；明知回去未必找得回那份亲近，心里还是忍不住想：万一能呢？\",\"source\":\"明知道回去未必找得回那份亲近，他却还是忍不住想：万一能呢？他再心动，也不愿只凭这点指望，就回去过从前那种忍让的日子。\",\"type\":\"7\",\"severity\":\"轻微\",\"why\":\"定稿先写忍不住期待回去的可能，再写不愿只凭这点指望回头；屏幕稿把拒绝放在前面、期待放在后面，颠倒了思绪顺序。\"},{\"sec\":\"S11\",\"screen\":\"回不回去以后再说，【先把眼下日子过稳些】更踏实\",\"source\":\"回不回去以后再说，先把眼下日子过稳些，也许比急着回去踏实。\",\"type\":\"2\",\"severity\":\"轻微\",\"why\":\"原文用“也许”表达尚不确定的判断，屏幕稿改成“更踏实”，把可能性变成了确定结论。\"}]}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "4bbab971-3c67-4514-ad12-db08f081473e", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261110T235316029375Z", "elapsed_seconds": 368.078, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T23:59:24.107157+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "ee8723700f32bf46107ad827ba2469a1e2688e25f55ca7cba045216992ce4528", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261110T235316029375Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "822cb77d020d06c631b655c586a80ab569c0432b554c3cbd79e4c7a17cb8251f"}}}
